{
  "id": "p22",
  "title": "The Little Theatre in the Garden",
  "titleZh": "花园里的小剧场",
  "topic": "露天剧场",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "Several local people come to a meeting in the walled garden.",
        "zh": "好几位本地人来到围墙花园里参加一次会议。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The old primary school lends a small outdoor theatre for the summer.",
        "zh": "老小学把一个小型露天剧场借给他们过夏天。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My mother says their summer season is popular with local families.",
        "zh": "我母亲说他们的夏季演出季很受本地家庭欢迎。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My sister, a young girl, will play the hero.",
        "zh": "我妹妹是个小姑娘，将扮演故事里的英雄。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A tall quiet boy plays a king in a bright gold crown.",
        "zh": "一个高个安静的男孩戴着闪亮的金冠扮演国王。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One brave guard must solve a murder before the clock strikes.",
        "zh": "一位勇敢的卫兵必须在钟声敲响前破解一桩谋杀案。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They practise a perfect circle around the wooden stage.",
        "zh": "他们围着木舞台练习一个完美的圆圈。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My uncle and two helpers lift a heavy wooden box.",
        "zh": "我叔叔和两个帮手抬上一个沉重的木箱。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An old television stands in the corner, dusty and dark.",
        "zh": "一台旧电视摆在角落里，满是灰尘，黑漆漆的。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A grey cat sleeps on the soft grass near the wall.",
        "zh": "一只灰猫在墙边的软草地上睡觉。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "She must write all her lines in a new and difficult language.",
        "zh": "她必须用一种新的、难学的语言写下所有台词。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The teacher examines each page and adds a short note in red.",
        "zh": "老师检查每一页，并用红笔加上简短的批注。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One careful person checks every thing that is necessary.",
        "zh": "一位细心的人检查每一样必要的东西。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She essentially avoids the part that makes her truly afraid.",
        "zh": "她基本上避开了让她真正害怕的那部分。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then, once the music starts, the whole show will begin soon.",
        "zh": "然后，音乐一响起，整场演出很快就会开始。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A kind neighbour lets them borrow a silver hat for the play.",
        "zh": "一位好心的邻居让他们借一顶银色的帽子演出用。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During the morning, they wash the dirty curtains for the show.",
        "zh": "上午，他们为演出洗那些脏窗帘。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One young actor hurts his arm and gets injured on the step.",
        "zh": "一个年轻演员摔倒，在台阶上伤了手臂。"
      },
      {
        "en": "It is a shame that he coughs through the quiet scene.",
        "zh": "遗憾的是他在安静的这一幕里一直咳嗽。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Their quick hello grows into a warm and lasting friendship.",
        "zh": "他们匆匆的一声问候长成了温暖而持久的友谊。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Later they take a certain train for a mile to the old town.",
        "zh": "后来他们坐上一班特定的火车，走一英里到老镇。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Parents drive eighteen happy children to the wooden gate.",
        "zh": "父母开车送十八个快乐的孩子到木门前。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The town law bans any race on this quiet little street.",
        "zh": "镇上的法律禁止在这条安静的小街上进行任何赛跑。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then, by the twentieth show, their level has clearly risen again.",
        "zh": "然后，到第二十场演出时，他们的水平明显又提高了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Much work remains, but few people seem worried or tired.",
        "zh": "还有很多工作，但很少有人显得担心或疲倦。"
      },
      {
        "en": "There is no easy way back after the red curtain opens.",
        "zh": "红幕拉开后，就没有轻松的回头路了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They need more time to sort the coats and heavy bags.",
        "zh": "他们需要更多时间来整理外套和沉重的包。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The old stage has its charm, which everyone loves tonight.",
        "zh": "老舞台有它自己的魅力，今晚每个人都喜欢。"
      }
    ]
  ],
